# {{ app_name }} - {{ project_name }}

Python agent service (Python {{ versions.python }}, FastAPI {{ versions.fastapi }}, uv), generated by Prism's `python-agent-service` pack at `{{ app_path }}/`. It holds one working slice: `GET /api/health` and `POST /api/assist`, one agent turn through a provider interface with one example tool, with their tests and an evaluation harness. Everything else is yours to build.

